---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "FAQ"
description: "Straight, grouped answers to the questions a sceptic asks about Uncost — what it is, how it is funded, how evidence is handled, where AI and robotics fit, and what exists today."
---
{% import "partials/mailto.njk" as mail %}
{% set emailHtml = mail.email() %}

<section class="blk blk--first">
  <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
  <h1>Straight answers.</h1>
  <p class="lead">{{ faq.standfirst }}</p>
</section>

{% for section in faq.sections %}
<section class="blk{% if loop.index0 is even %} blk--cream2{% endif %}">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.heading }}</p>
  <h2 class="sec">{{ section.heading }}.</h2>
  {% for item in section.items %}
  <h3>{{ item.q }}</h3>
  <p>{{ item.a | replace("[[EMAIL]]", emailHtml) | safe }}</p>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endfor %}

<section class="blk blk--ink">
  <p class="eyebrow">Still curious?</p>
  <h2 class="sec">Ask us anything.</h2>
  <p>If your question isn’t here, write to us and a human will reply — {{ mail.email() }}. If a question comes up often, it joins this page.</p>
  <p>
    <a href="/pledge" class="u-btn u-btn--primary">Sign the Pledge</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="u-btn u-btn--outline-cream">Contact</a>
  </p>
</section>
